{"id":"vod_bf_9133","vodId":"9133","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"反叛的鲁路修第一季","name_cn":"反叛的鲁路修第一季","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-10/a1abccc149b886f3e2ee291b1a9384dc.jpg"},"summary":"鲁路修本是帝国的王子，在母后遇害后，和失明的妹妹一起被流放到11区（原日本国）作为人质。在那里他们结识了日本王子朱雀，三人共同度过一段美好的童年时光。帝国最终全面攻陷了11区，鲁路修和妹妹的安宁生活再次被剥夺，朱雀和他们也分散了。　　鲁路修和妹妹隐瞒身份，过着看似平凡的学生生活。然而鲁路修心中对于帝国的仇恨却未停止。他希望摧毁帝国，为妹妹营造一个可以快乐生活的世界。这一切随着神秘少女C.C的出现变得不再遥不可及。　　此时朱雀也再次出现在他们的生活中，然而残酷的现实让童年的挚友难以重温童年往事。这里没有正义和邪恶，黑暗与光明，有的仅仅是艰难的抉择和难以预料的明天。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"科幻,动画,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 18:43:09","classic":true,"classicRank":16,"franchise":"Code Geass","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/fanpandeluluxiudiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/fanpandeluluxiudiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/fanpandeluluxiudiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/fanpandeluluxiudiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/fanpandeluluxiudiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/fanpandeluluxiudiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/fanpandeluluxiudiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/fanpandeluluxiudiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/fanpandeluluxiudiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/fanpandeluluxiudiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/fanpandeluluxiudiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/fanpandeluluxiudiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c